Sept. 8th at 8am PDT (<a href=3D"https://zoom.us/j/990892712"><span =
style=3D'color:#1155CC'>https://zoom.us/j/990892712)</span></a><o:p></o:p=
></span></li><li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'color:black;mso-list:l3 =
